1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,800
BILLION'da yangi aksiya!

2
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:10,600
Klubga olti marta keling — bir soat o'yin sizga bepul!

3
00:00:11,333 --> 00:00:15,400
Har bir tashrifingiz hisobingizga yoziladi.

4
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:18,733
Oltinchi tashrif — va sovg'a sizniki!

5
00:00:19,467 --> 00:00:25,067
Bir soatlik o'yin kuponi — butunlay bepul.

6
00:00:25,733 --> 00:00:28,533
Kupon darhol Telegram botingizga keladi.

7
00:00:28,667 --> 00:00:31,133
Keyingi safar ko'rsating — va bepul o'ynang!

8
00:00:31,733 --> 00:00:34,333
Hali botda yo'qmisiz? «Start» ni bosing!

9
00:00:34,467 --> 00:00:36,667
BILLION — sizni kutamiz!

